<title>POLAND: SOKOLOW 96 NET RISES TO PLN 7.7 MLN.</title>
<headline>SOKOLOW 96 NET RISES TO PLN 7.7 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results December</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.77 vs   0.44</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.50 vs   0.60</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.50 vs   0.12</p>
<p> Sales		   23.98 vs  18.40</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     7.70 vs   5.41</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	13.26 vs   9.71</p>
<p> Operating profit    12.98 vs   5.72</p>
<p> Sales		  242.40 vs 175.36</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish meat firm is Sokolow SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
